{"4646090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Akonite Fall", "steam_appid": 4646090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The kingdom is under threat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy is approaching, seeking to break down the defenses and destroy the prosperous cities. The king calls you in these hard times! Defend castles against the hordes of dark creatures summoned by the mysterious Obelisk. Build and upgrade towers, combine damage types and try tower combos - make your own builds. Your choices will shape the fate of the war! Will you stand against the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646090/extras/8b3513a899808f217be14b4c43ef3a50.avif?t=1780311204\" width=1020 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exciting campaign with economical system and events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a full-fledged campaign where your actions truly matter. An economic system ties all levels together — fight, and you will be rewarded! Gain new upgrades and become stronger. Your current achievements directly shape what lies ahead! Global and local events make each run unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Branching towers upgrade system and unique special abilities in every branch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command towers that deal physical and magical damage. Combine them, upgrade them and unlock special abilities to unleash crushing combos. Forge your own builds to master every level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4646090/extras/1249ca0424211cf53652390a5359a840.poster.avif?t=1780311204\" width=800 heig